{"seq":2,"slug":"model-cost-quality","title":"模型复杂度与效果的权衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/ranking-blending-performance/ranking-funnel/model-cost-quality","wordCount":2828,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"模型复杂度与效果的权衡\">模型复杂度与效果的权衡</h1><p>把精排模型的层数加深一倍、特征从两百个扩到八百个，离线指标通常会有可测量的提升；但线上延迟会同步上升，而延迟上升的代价是负面的——用户等得越久，转化越低。这是排序系统里最经典也最容易被拍脑袋决定的一组取舍：模型该做多大。拍脑袋之所以常见，是因为两边都不好量化：效果可以用离线 AUC 或线上 A/B 的点击率衡量，但&quot;多等 20 毫秒损失多少转化&quot;往往没有现成的数。这一篇要做的是把两边都换算到可比较的尺度上，再给出几种有理论依据的复杂度分配策略。</p>\n<p>本篇与 <a href=\"cascade-stages\">召回、粗排、精排、重排的延迟预算分配</a> 的分工是：那一篇讲毫秒该分给哪一段，这一篇讲分到毫秒之后该买什么样的模型。与 <a href=\"early-exit\">级联截断与早退优化</a> 的分工是：那一篇讲如何在模型之外少算，这一篇讲模型自身的大小选择。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-边际收益递减与延迟线性上升\">核心概念：边际收益递减与延迟线性上升</h2><p>模型复杂度的收益曲线与成本曲线形状不同，这决定了最优规模必然存在内部解。</p>\n<p><strong>收益侧</strong>：把打分模型看成对&quot;这条候选是否该排在前面&quot;的函数逼近。随着参数量与特征数增长，逼近误差下降，但下降速度递减。经验上，离线排序指标（比如 NDCG@10）随模型容量的增长近似对数形式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>b</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G(\\theta) \\approx G_{\\infty} - a \\cdot \\theta^{-b}, \\quad b &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∞</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0935em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 是容量度量（参数量或 FLOPs），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_\\infty</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∞</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是任务的可达上限，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 是衰减指数。这意味着容量翻倍带来的增益会越来越小——从 1M 参数到 10M 参数可能涨 3 个点，从 100M 到 1B 只涨 0.3 个点（来源：Kaplan et al., &quot;Scaling Laws for Neural Language Models&quot;, arXiv:2001.08361, 2020——损失随模型规模/数据量/算力呈幂律下降，边际收益递减, <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2001.08361）。\">https://arxiv.org/abs/2001.08361）。</a></p>\n<p><strong>成本侧</strong>：延迟近似与容量线性甚至超线性。前向计算量与参数和输入长度近似成正比，若把特征数也计入输入维度，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T(\\theta) \\approx t_0 + k \\cdot \\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是固定开销（框架调度、张量分配），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 是单位容量的时间成本。在带 GPU 批处理的部署里，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 会被批大小摊薄——这一点非常重要，它意味着&quot;多算候选&quot;和&quot;加大模型&quot;的成本互相影响。</p>\n<p>把两条曲线放在一起，可以定义<strong>单位效果成本</strong>：每多花一毫秒买到的效果增量。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>efficiency</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>G</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>T</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mi>k</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{efficiency}(\\theta) = \\frac{G&#x27;(\\theta)}{T&#x27;(\\theta)} \\approx \\frac{a b \\theta^{-b-1}}{k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">efficiency</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3649em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4289em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6779em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2121em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5261em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ab</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>由于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，这个量随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 单调递减——<strong>在纯算力角度看，模型越大越不划算</strong>。那为什么线上模型还在变大？因为收益侧还有一个小时延无法反映的效应：大模型对<strong>分布外样本</strong>和<strong>长尾查询</strong>的鲁棒性明显更好，而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G(\\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的拟合往往基于整体平均，掩盖了尾部收益。正确的评估必须分段看边际收益。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>容量区间</th>\n<th>离线增益</th>\n<th>延迟代价</th>\n<th>长尾鲁棒性</th>\n<th>典型结论</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>线性/浅层（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 参数级）</td>\n<td>基线</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>差</td>\n<td>适合粗排、端侧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中等深度 MLP/GBDT（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>7</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td>增益显著</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>精排主力，性价比拐点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>宽深交叉网络（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>7</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td>增益递减</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>较好</td>\n<td>头部查询有明显收益</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大模型/交叉编码器（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>+）</td>\n<td>增益进一步递减</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>最好</td>\n<td>只用在几十条候选上</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[容量 theta 增加] --&gt; B[逼近误差下降 对数形式]&#10;    A --&gt; C[前向时间线性上升]&#10;    B --&gt; D{边际效果 对比 边际延迟}&#10;    C --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt;|收益大于代价| E[继续扩容]&#10;    D --&gt;|代价大于收益| F[到达内部最优]&#10;    E --&gt; G{是否受批处理摊薄}&#10;    G --&gt;|批大| H[单位成本下降 可容忍更大模型]&#10;    G --&gt;|批小| I[单位成本高 应缩小模型]&#10;    F --&gt; J[分段验证长尾收益]&#10;    J --&gt;|长尾收益显著| E&#10;    J --&gt;|仅均值收益| K[停止扩容]\">graph TD\n    A[容量 theta 增加] --&gt; B[逼近误差下降 对数形式]\n    A --&gt; C[前向时间线性上升]\n    B --&gt; D{边际效果 对比 边际延迟}\n    C --&gt; D\n    D --&gt;|收益大于代价| E[继续扩容]\n    D --&gt;|代价大于收益| F[到达内部最优]\n    E --&gt; G{是否受批处理摊薄}\n    G --&gt;|批大| H[单位成本下降 可容忍更大模型]\n    G --&gt;|批小| I[单位成本高 应缩小模型]\n    F --&gt; J[分段验证长尾收益]\n    J --&gt;|长尾收益显著| E\n    J --&gt;|仅均值收益| K[停止扩容]</pre><h2 id=\"特征数与模型深度的不对称成本\">特征数与模型深度的不对称成本</h2><p>&quot;模型复杂度&quot;其实包含两个可独立调节的量：<strong>特征维度</strong>与<strong>网络深度</strong>。它们的成本结构截然不同，而常见错误是把两者一起加。</p>\n<p>特征维度的成本落在<strong>数据获取</strong>上，不在矩阵乘法上。一个 800 维输入的 MLP 第一层矩阵乘法成本远小于去特征存储取 800 个特征的网络与序列化开销。所以加特征的主要代价是等待时间（其治理见第二章），而它带来的延迟是<strong>阶梯式</strong>的：跨过一个扇出阈值或缓存容量阈值，延迟会跳变。深度的成本则落在<strong>计算</strong>上，是平滑的线性增长。两者的分界线给出了一条实用准则：<strong>当模型已经算得很快、但端到端依然慢时，问题在特征侧，加深度无用；当特征已经很热、端到端依然慢时，才考虑砍深度换候选数。</strong></p>\n<p>特征维度还有一个隐蔽的效应：<strong>稀疏特征的基数</strong>。用户 ID、查询 ID、商品 ID 这类高基数特征的嵌入表可能有上亿行，虽然每次只查几行，但嵌入表的总内存决定了能否常驻、是否需要分片、分片后是否要跨网络取。这是把&quot;特征数&quot;当成本量时最容易漏掉的一项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三种复杂度分配策略\">三种复杂度分配策略</h2><p>根据前面的分析，实践中收敛出三种策略，它们的适用条件互不重叠。</p>\n<p><strong>策略一：级联差异化。</strong> 前面的阶段用极轻模型，后面的阶段用重模型。粗排用双塔内积或浅层 GBDT（单条几十微秒），精排用多层网络（单条数百微秒），重排才用交叉编码器（单条数毫秒到数十毫秒）。这个策略的根据是候选量级：粗排要看几千条，所以单条成本必须压到微秒级；重排只看几十条，单条成本可以高三个数量级。这是当前最主流的做法，也是 <a href=\"cascade-stages\">召回、粗排、精排、重排的延迟预算分配</a> 中&quot;四段单条成本差三到四个数量级&quot;的直接体现。</p>\n<p><strong>策略二：蒸馏保形。</strong> 用一个大的教师模型在离线为海量查询-候选对打分，然后用这些小模型的输出训练一个小的学生模型（知识蒸馏）。学生模型学的是教师的排序<strong>偏好</strong>而不是硬标签，因此可以在参数量下降一到两个数量级的同时保住大部分排序质量（来源：Hinton, Vinyals &amp; Dean, &quot;Distilling the Knowledge in a Neural Network&quot;, arXiv:1503.02531, 2015, <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1503.02531）。代价是教师模型的推理成本要离线摊掉，且学生模型对训练分布之外的样本泛化依赖教师覆盖度。这条路线是\">https://arxiv.org/abs/1503.02531）。代价是教师模型的推理成本要离线摊掉，且学生模型对训练分布之外的样本泛化依赖教师覆盖度。这条路线是</a> <a href=\"../ranking-frontiers/llm-rerank\">LLM 重排的延迟与成本</a> 中把大模型成本压下来的核心手段之一。</p>\n<p><strong>策略三：头部加大、长尾保底。</strong> 不追求单一模型规模，而是按查询价值分流：头部高价值查询（大促词、品牌词）走大模型，长尾查询走小模型。分流判据可以是查询频次、也可是查询本身的复杂度（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 的大小、召回分数的分布宽度）。这条策略的延迟收益来自&quot;长尾占多数&quot;——如果 80% 的流量走小模型，整体算力占用与 p99 都会显著改善，而效果损失只落在价值最低的那部分查询上。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[查询进入精排] --&gt; B{查询价值分层}&#10;    B --&gt;|头部高价值| C[大模型 数百微秒每条]&#10;    B --&gt;|长尾| D[小模型 数十微秒每条]&#10;    C --&gt; E[候选 200 条]&#10;    D --&gt; F[候选 400 条]&#10;    E --&gt; G[统一进入重排]&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[交叉编码器 只看 top 50]\">flowchart TD\n    A[查询进入精排] --&gt; B{查询价值分层}\n    B --&gt;|头部高价值| C[大模型 数百微秒每条]\n    B --&gt;|长尾| D[小模型 数十微秒每条]\n    C --&gt; E[候选 200 条]\n    D --&gt; F[候选 400 条]\n    E --&gt; G[统一进入重排]\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[交叉编码器 只看 top 50]</pre><h2 id=\"怎么把两边换算到同一把尺子上\">怎么把两边换算到同一把尺子上</h2><p>要判断&quot;多 20 毫秒值不值&quot;，需要把延迟换算成业务量。可用的一条经验链是：延迟 → 用户行为 → 业务指标。公开的行业研究长期观察到延迟与转化之间存在近似幂律关系，通常表述为&quot;延迟每增加 100ms，转化率下降约 1% 量级&quot;（不同场景差异很大，必须用自己的数据校准；可考的早期观测是 Amazon 按 100ms 增量人为延迟页面、发现即使很小的延迟也会降低收入，但该来源并未给出「1%」这一具体系数，故此处量级仅供校准起点而非通用常数——来源：Greg Linden, &quot;Marissa Mayer at Web 2.0&quot;, 2006, <a href=\"https://glinden.blogspot.com/2006/11/marissa-mayer-at-web-20.html）。若设转化率对延迟的弹性为\">https://glinden.blogspot.com/2006/11/marissa-mayer-at-web-20.html）。若设转化率对延迟的弹性为</a> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mtext>CVR</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>CVR</mtext></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon = \\frac{\\partial \\text{CVR} / \\text{CVR}}{\\partial T / T}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.53em;vertical-align:-0.52em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">CVR</span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">CVR</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.52em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则一个把 p50 延迟增加 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 的模型改动，其可接受的离线指标改善下界为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mtext>NDCG</mtext><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>≈</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mi>ϵ</mi><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><mi>T</mi></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mtext>NDCG</mtext><mtext>CVR elasticity</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta \\text{NDCG}_{\\min} \\approx \\left| \\epsilon \\right| \\cdot \\frac{\\Delta T}{T} \\cdot \\frac{\\text{NDCG}}{\\text{CVR elasticity}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NDCG</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">∣</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CVR elasticity</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NDCG</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个式子的用处不是精确计算，而是<strong>强制把延迟写进上线判据</strong>。多数团队的实验框架只比较效果指标，延迟作为&quot;监控项&quot;存在，于是模型会一代代变大直到 SLO 报警才回头——把延迟变成上线门槛之一，比事后优化便宜得多。</p>\n<p>还应当区分<strong>均值延迟</strong>与<strong>尾延迟</strong>在这条换算中的不同权重。均值延迟影响所有用户，尾延迟只影响一小部分但影响极深（超时、白屏、放弃）。因此同一个模型的膨胀如果只推高了 p50，其代价可以用上面的弹性估；如果推高了 p99，代价要以流失率而非转化率来估，通常严重得多。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>判断问题</th>\n<th>该看的量</th>\n<th>常用手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>该不该扩容模型</td>\n<td>分段的边际收益 vs 边际延迟</td>\n<td>离线扫容量画帕累托前沿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扩容的收益是否真实</td>\n<td>长尾分段的指标（不只均值）</td>\n<td>按查询频次分层评估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟代价是否可接受</td>\n<td>均值弹性 + 尾延迟流失率</td>\n<td>把延迟写进上线判据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>该加特征还是加深度</td>\n<td>端到端瓶颈在等待还是计算</td>\n<td>分解 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>wait</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{wait}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">wait</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\cdot c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大模型成本如何压</td>\n<td>蒸馏后学生的保真度</td>\n<td>离线蒸馏 + 学生上线</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>模型复杂度这件事的难点在于两条曲线形状不同：收益对数衰减、成本线性上升，所以最优规模必然存在，而且通常比直觉小。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>容量翻倍的收益越来越小（近似 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_\\infty - a\\theta^{-b}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∞</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），延迟却近似线性上升，纯算力视角下模型越大越不划算；模型仍在变大是因为长尾鲁棒性收益不出现在均值指标里。</li>\n<li>特征维度与网络深度的成本结构不同：前者是阶梯式的数据获取成本（含高基数嵌入表的内存），后者是平滑的计算成本；加特征前先确认瓶颈不在等待侧。</li>\n<li>三种分配策略各有适用面：级联差异化（主流）、蒸馏保形（压大模型成本）、头部加大长尾保底（按查询价值分流）。</li>\n<li>把延迟换算成业务量、并把延迟写进上线判据，比事后压缩模型便宜；尾延迟要用流失率而非转化率来估。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>分好了配额也选好了模型，下一步是在给定配额内进一步少算——级联截断如何设点、模型内部如何早退，见 <a href=\"early-exit\">级联截断与早退优化</a>。特征维度带来的等待成本如何治理，是第二章的核心，从 <a href=\"../feature-serving/feature-fetch-cache\">特征获取、缓存与本地化</a> 开始；高基数嵌入表的分片思路与 <a href=\"../feature-serving/feature-store-latency\">特征存储的延迟治理</a> 中讨论的存储侧问题同源。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"模型复杂度与效果的权衡","id":"模型复杂度与效果的权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：边际收益递减与延迟线性上升","id":"核心概念-边际收益递减与延迟线性上升"},{"level":2,"text":"特征数与模型深度的不对称成本","id":"特征数与模型深度的不对称成本"},{"level":2,"text":"三种复杂度分配策略","id":"三种复杂度分配策略"},{"level":2,"text":"怎么把两边换算到同一把尺子上","id":"怎么把两边换算到同一把尺子上"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"召回、粗排、精排、重排的延迟预算分配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/ranking-blending-performance/ranking-funnel/cascade-stages"},"next":{"title":"级联截断与早退优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/ranking-blending-performance/ranking-funnel/early-exit"}}